<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-121-B habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.471212" lon="-121.029622"><name>SC26-121-B</name><desc>Point Estero rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 9.3 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 72/100; not catch probability. Center 63 ft; nearby 56–83 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-096</name><desc>Partial mapped habitat footprint clipped to a 125-m search window to retain complete depth coverage; not the entire reef or a single pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.47107920382093" lon="-121.02825436136973"/><trkpt lat="35.47066116912016" lon="-121.02842059122104"/><trkpt lat="35.47032699358512" lon="-121.02876972102736"/><trkpt lat="35.47012755112319" lon="-121.0292485985681"/><trkpt lat="35.470093204060184" lon="-121.02978432105706"/><trkpt lat="35.47022918132608" lon="-121.03029533277187"/><trkpt lat="35.470514782455865" lon="-121.03070383931653"/><trkpt lat="35.47090652855498" lon="-121.03094764964547"/><trkpt lat="35.471344780812224" lon="-121.03098964386812"/><trkpt lat="35.47176281939329" lon="-121.03082342557433"/><trkpt lat="35.472097000872665" lon="-121.03047429748702"/><trkpt lat="35.472296447860856" lon="-121.02999541081984"/><trkpt lat="35.472330795380614" lon="-121.02945967370512"/><trkpt lat="35.472194814234406" lon="-121.02894865043281"/><trkpt lat="35.4719092071603" lon="-121.02854014216915"/><trkpt lat="35.471517456534926" lon="-121.02829634096663"/><trkpt lat="35.47107920382093" lon="-121.02825436136973"/></trkseg></trk><trk><name>SC-DRIFT-121</name><desc>Principal axis of raised mapped rough habitat within 180 m of target. Optional structure alignment; actual drift depends on measured wind/current. Not a navigation route.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.469413953083084" lon="-121.02977916336893"/><trkpt lat="35.47301004598116" lon="-121.0294648277061"/></trkseg></trk></gpx>
